            // Gauntlets up special, the leap (reference frame 14 is frame 13 here). Before it the move's air block gives the x6 acceleration, so
            // the stick builds up horizontal speed ("Tokyo drift"); from frame 13 to 30 the rise carries that speed on, plus a little forward
            // drive of its own, rising at 3.4 reference units a frame and slowing evenly to 0.4 (about 34 units up and 11 forward) [E: the
            // reference's rise is its animation, not published]. After it, the move's second air block (gravity 0.103).
            var base;
            if frame == 13 { base = vx; }
